(footprint "Kycon_KPJX-4S-S"
	(version 20240108)
	(generator "steel-guitar")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Kycon KPJX-4S-S, 4-position shielded snap-and-lock DC power jack (power DIN), right angle THT, 7.5 A per pin at 48 V. Land from Kycon's own 'Recommended PCB Layout' (drawing KPJX-4S-S rev A17, 08/15/22), which is a BOTTOM view and is mirrored here. Origin = the centre of the NOSE FRONT; the mouth is +Y. Distances behind the nose front: shield tab 5.50, pegs and front shield legs 7.50, pins 3/4 11.00, pins 1/2 14.65, rear shield legs 16.00. Looking INTO the mouth, pin 1 is top left, 2 top right, 3 bottom left, 4 bottom right. F.Fab is the 16.0 x 13.4 BODY only: the O12.9 x 4.0 nose stands in front of it (src/board_geom.PANEL). Mates Kycon KPPX-4P = Mean Well plug R7B: 1 +V, 2 -V, 3 -V, 4 +V.")
	(tags "Kycon KPJX power DIN 4 pin snap lock DC jack THT")
